{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach visible object, take it, check properties, do task. Scan area if object not found     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
